        <body>
            <div xml:id="d67">

                <pb facs="0083" n="77" xml:id="pg77"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Denby.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 68.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-08"><hi rendition="#italic">November 8,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>While President prefers to act alone, he will not decline request to act jointly
                    with other powers simply in determining amount of indemnity if Japan’s consent
                    is obtained.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
